	(text "Board is designed to be powered by different sources, two\ncoin cell batteries in series or a USB connector.\n\nR17 must not be populated when D4 is populated.  This\npopulation will cause USB Power to feed into the coin\ncell batteries if when both batteries are dead installed\nand both batteries are dead.\n\nWhen D3 and D4 are populated, the power source with the\nhigher voltage will power the board.\n\nWhen R17 is populated, the coin cells will be connected\nto Vcc bypassing the rectifying diodes.\n\nThe current population was tested and is configured to\nsupport both two coin cells and the USB-C receptacle."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 95.504 168.402 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.1588)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "053aaa55-2bff-482f-8e44-e0cd9fb701e8")
	)
	(text "POWER CONFIGURATION"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 93.98 166.116 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.905 1.905)
				(thickness 0.381)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "426d7816-5f02-4977-b77a-bcbc5cc4875a")
	)
	(text "Circuit is designed with a 3 color LED.  Each LED color can be set\nto blink or stay solid.  Populating R14, R15 and R16 will set each\nLED color to stay solid.  Populating R6, R7 and R8 will set each\nLED color to blink.  The board only has enough room to populate one\nsolid/blinking resistor for each color.\n\nCapacitor between BASE-xA and the first transistor collector pin is\na matched value to Capacitor between BASE-xB and the second\ntransistor collector pin.  Both Capacitors are referred to as 'C'.\n\nResistor between BASE-xA and ground is referred to as Ron.\n\nResistor between BASE-xB and ground is referred to as Roff.\n\nThe Frequency of the blinking is (0.69 * C * ((Ron + Roff) / 2)).\n\nThe Duty Cycle of the LED is (Ron / (Ron + Roff)).\n\nThe current population was tested and is configured to support\nthree colors blinking as follows:\n - Red blinking 1 second on, 1 second off\n - Green blinking 2 second on, 1 second off\n - Blue blinking 3 second on, 1 second off"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 18.034 19.812 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.1588)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "796ca012-8f1c-4d76-bedc-19d7046273b0")
	)
	(text "LED CONFIGURATION"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16.51 17.526 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.905 1.905)
				(thickness 0.381)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "ef8f0038-cd28-4b02-a050-588b1bd2d131")
	)
